1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,613
MoveBooks AI is built on Google Cloud and powered by Gemini AI.

2
00:00:04,793 --> 00:00:10,067
It guides accounting migration from readiness assessment through
verified first productive use.

3
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:16,131
Follow the customer journey, with genuine Gemini results and a
verified synthetic accounting outcome.

4
00:00:16,311 --> 00:00:18,297
The public demo needs no sign-in.

5
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:21,939
My Migration uses Google access for approved accounts.

6
00:00:22,119 --> 00:00:28,099
This entry screen is signed out; we will move to recorded
workspace evidence rather than simulate signing

7
00:00:28,099 --> 00:00:28,270
in.

8
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:33,394
The MVP uses synthetic books, with no live accounting-provider
integration.

9
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:38,910
We begin with Understand.

10
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:45,485
The public demo introduces Harbor Light Books, a fictional shop,
and the questions to resolve before moving

11
00:00:45,485 --> 00:00:46,024
anything.

12
00:00:46,184 --> 00:00:52,086
For the detailed workspace journey, we now switch to a recording
of the real application working with local

13
00:00:52,086 --> 00:00:52,968
synthetic books.

14
00:00:53,813 --> 00:00:58,037
This is a recorded example with synthetic books, not a new
production migration.

15
00:00:58,197 --> 00:01:02,017
The user reviews source records, readiness and the proposed
scope.

16
00:01:02,177 --> 00:01:05,709
Missing information needs attention before the plan progresses.

17
00:01:05,869 --> 00:01:11,326
The purpose is to make the risks visible early, while the user
still controls what happens next.

18
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:16,703
Prepare turns that understanding into a migration plan.

19
00:01:16,863 --> 00:01:21,870
An account name alone is not enough: the destination must
preserve the meaning of the source.

20
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:27,392
The existing mapping view brings suggested matches, confidence
and review status together.

21
00:01:27,552 --> 00:01:31,955
Ambiguous or sensitive choices still need a person to examine
the evidence.

22
00:01:32,115 --> 00:01:36,919
This recorded example shows the separate human decisions around
mappings and the plan.

23
00:01:37,114 --> 00:01:39,904
These are recorded decisions, not new approvals.

24
00:01:40,064 --> 00:01:45,617
A suggestion is not consent, and approving a plan is distinct
from accepting an explanation.

25
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,301
Now we switch records.

26
00:01:49,461 --> 00:01:55,256
These genuine production screenshots show previously generated
Gemini results for the account twelve

27
00:01:55,256 --> 00:01:57,632
hundred, Misc Clearing, ready for review.

28
00:01:57,792 --> 00:02:01,591
Run AI-Assisted Analysis is visible, but we do not click it.

29
00:02:01,751 --> 00:02:05,561
We are reviewing a saved response, not generating a new one.

30
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:11,675
The Advisor explains why this mapping needs judgment.

31
00:02:11,835 --> 00:02:14,433
The proposed destination is Other Current Asset.

32
00:02:14,593 --> 00:02:21,040
Its supplied candidate confidence is zero point seven six: a
mapping input, not a guarantee of model

33
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,620
accuracy.

34
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:24,913
The source purpose and acceptance criteria are missing.

35
00:02:25,073 --> 00:02:31,030
The recommendation is to escalate to a qualified human, grounded
in the escalation flag and policy

36
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:31,760
constraints.

37
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:36,388
The explanation preserves uncertainty instead of inventing an
accounting story.

38
00:02:38,567 --> 00:02:40,968
The independent Reviewer returns QUESTION.

39
00:02:41,128 --> 00:02:44,904
It challenges the recommendation against the supplied source
facts.

40
00:02:45,064 --> 00:02:49,770
A compatible account type does not establish a clearing
account's business purpose.

41
00:02:49,930 --> 00:02:55,061
The Reviewer highlights the missing purpose, confidence
threshold and need for human review.

42
00:02:55,221 --> 00:02:57,976
Accepting reasoning is never approval of the mapping.

43
00:02:58,136 --> 00:03:02,295
Neither Advisor nor Reviewer can authorize a migration or post
an invoice.

44
00:03:02,455 --> 00:03:04,392
The human retains that authority.

45
00:03:06,567 --> 00:03:11,113
Here, the saved explanation brings the mapping's supporting
evidence into view.

46
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:13,760
Private details stay hidden.

47
00:03:13,932 --> 00:03:18,971
Saved results belong to their mapping; switching context clears
outdated analysis.

48
00:03:19,142 --> 00:03:22,442
Reopening retrieves the existing explanation for review.

49
00:03:22,783 --> 00:03:23,970
No model is called.

50
00:03:24,188 --> 00:03:26,949
The reopening itself is not shown in this footage.

51
00:03:27,504 --> 00:03:32,705
The saved snapshot informs a person; deterministic validation
remains authoritative.

52
00:03:34,867 --> 00:03:36,959
We review an existing local journey.

53
00:03:37,119 --> 00:03:43,281
This is a different synthetic record from the Gemini analysis in
this collection.

54
00:03:43,441 --> 00:03:48,541
In Move, the recorded run encounters a controlled duplicate and
pauses the affected work.

55
00:03:48,701 --> 00:03:52,429
Completed checkpoints remain intact while the exception is
reviewed.

56
00:03:52,589 --> 00:03:57,068
The footage shows the existing recovery sequence and its human
decision boundary.

57
00:03:57,228 --> 00:04:02,618
It is historical playback, not a retry or migration executed
during this recording.

58
00:04:02,778 --> 00:04:08,759
The practical benefit is controlled recovery: resolve the
permitted problem without replaying work that has

59
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:09,765
already completed.

60
00:04:11,933 --> 00:04:14,142
Moving records is only part of the job.

61
00:04:14,302 --> 00:04:17,869
Verify examines whether the result is financially consistent.

62
00:04:18,029 --> 00:04:24,148
The accepted local run recorded seventeen deterministic
validation checks, followed by review of

63
00:04:24,148 --> 00:04:25,422
configuration areas.

64
00:04:25,582 --> 00:04:30,493
These are rule-based checks, not generated opinions or AI
confidence scores.

65
00:04:30,653 --> 00:04:34,813
A failed financial check cannot be waived by a reassuring
explanation.

66
00:04:34,973 --> 00:04:40,169
Counts, relationships and financial results must satisfy their
own contracts.

67
00:04:40,329 --> 00:04:44,254
Configuration and sensitive approvals remain separate decisions.

68
00:04:44,414 --> 00:04:49,929
The customer gains evidence of what was checked, rather than
just a progress bar reaching the end.

69
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:57,715
Start asks a more useful question than whether the import
finished: can the business complete its first

70
00:04:57,715 --> 00:04:59,078
governed accounting task?

71
00:04:59,238 --> 00:05:05,536
The archival run reviews onboarding and the invoice contract,
then records the approved synthetic action and

72
00:05:05,536 --> 00:05:06,527
its verification.

73
00:05:06,687 --> 00:05:08,641
No invoice is being posted now.

74
00:05:08,801 --> 00:05:15,211
For this local record, the invoice subtotal is one hundred US
dollars, tax is seven dollars and twenty-five

75
00:05:15,211 --> 00:05:19,764
cents, and the total is one hundred and seven dollars and
twenty-five cents.

76
00:05:19,924 --> 00:05:23,149
The screen confirms Verified First Productive Use.

77
00:05:23,309 --> 00:05:29,358
Those figures belong to this recorded local journey; they are
not totals from the separate Gemini migration

78
00:05:29,358 --> 00:05:31,167
or a new production transaction.

79
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:38,122
Evidence and Results lets the user inspect the recorded
decisions behind progress.

80
00:05:38,282 --> 00:05:41,663
My Migration then provides a place to return to that work.

81
00:05:41,823 --> 00:05:44,282
The archived workspace is already complete.

82
00:05:44,442 --> 00:05:48,393
Its local AI activity view is not proof of Gemini execution.

83
00:05:48,553 --> 00:05:53,879
The genuine Gemini evidence shown earlier comes from the
separately identified production capture.

84
00:05:56,013 --> 00:06:01,192
Learn brings nine video guides together, with English captions
to support each stage of the journey.

85
00:06:01,363 --> 00:06:04,881
Choose a guide when you need a clear explanation of the next
decision.

86
00:06:05,052 --> 00:06:10,580
The Guide connects the stages to practical steps, from
understanding the source to reviewing results.

87
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:17,431
Trust and Security explains the controls: people approve
consequential decisions, rules verify financial

88
00:06:17,431 --> 00:06:20,321
facts, and workspaces belong to their owners.

89
00:06:20,491 --> 00:06:23,768
Use that guidance alongside the evidence in your own workspace.

90
00:06:23,938 --> 00:06:29,887
Gemini advice supports judgment; it does not replace permission,
financial checks or accountability.

91
00:06:30,057 --> 00:06:34,572
This is a bounded synthetic MVP, not a live accounting-provider
migration.

92
00:06:36,435 --> 00:06:40,751
The customer outcome is a guided move with evidence at every
consequential decision.

93
00:06:40,919 --> 00:06:45,849
Gemini explains uncertainty, and an independent Reviewer
challenges the recommendation.

94
00:06:46,017 --> 00:06:50,325
People retain authority, while exact checks determine financial
validity.

95
00:06:50,493 --> 00:06:55,102
The recorded local journey and saved production Gemini example
are separate records.

96
00:06:55,271 --> 00:07:01,173
Together they show preparation, governed recovery and a verified
first productive task, without claiming a

97
00:07:01,173 --> 00:07:02,120
new live session.

